          "chunk_id": "s06_c01",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s06_c1_evaluation_two_standard_citation_gra",
          "text": "The evaluation uses two standard citation graphs, Cora-ML and Citeseer, with a few thousand nodes each, and two representative backbones, a graph convolution network and a graph attention network.",
